    "background_story": "Galilea was a brilliant IT specialist who had a vision for a more connected and efficient world. Growing up in a small town with limited access to technology, she understood the importance of digitalization in bridging the gap between communities. After completing her studies, Galilea joined a team of innovators working on a project to bring high-speed internet to rural areas. Her expertise in network architecture and cybersecurity proved invaluable, and soon the project was rolled out to great success. Galilea's work enabled thousands of people to access essential services, education, and job opportunities online. She continued to push the boundaries of digitalization, developing AI-powered tools to help small businesses and entrepreneurs thrive in the digital economy. Galilea's dedication to harnessing technology for social good earned her recognition as a leading figure in the field of digitalization.",
